% hand_director — h's director written out, so --interface has a package to read (it reads none for a generated one; spec/18 §3).
catalog hand_director 1.
provenance text "generated at link from the composition's ports (spec/17 §3.3)" "2026-10-28".
include "iface/director_tree_domain.llp".
include "capacity.llp".

type kind {none}.
bwd specialist(domain).
specialist(h).
young_grant(a0).
young_grant(a1).
mature_grant(a2).
mature_grant(a3).
mature_status(a1).
mature_status(a2).
mature_status(a3).

#init free(hand) 1
#init gen(hand, g0, woken) 1
#init offpath(h) 1
#init nowant(h) 1
#init nolate(h) 1
#init nocommit(h) 1
#init age_of(h, a0) 1
#init issue(hand, t0) 1
#init serving(hand, t0) 1
#steps 6
#seeds 1
